#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:4 c32d7560b1bc4d5d84ab6b825ec534ef
msgid "Adding a scheme"
msgstr "添加提取方案"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:6 82721c9652c94c2eb5ae2d89323638e6
msgid ""
"Adding a new site is intentionally low-friction: most schemes are 5–15 lines"
" of declarative config plus one end-to-end test. A scheme declares which "
"response bodies it recognises (``flags``), how to pull structured data out "
"of them (``regex`` or ``extract_json``), and how to name the values it "
"produces (``fields``). Nothing is compiled or registered by hand — you add a"
" dict entry and a test, and the extractor picks it up."
msgstr ""
"添加一个新站点特意做得非常轻量：大多数提取方案只需 5–15 行声明式配置外加一个端到端测试。一个提取方案声明它能识别哪些响应体（\\ "
"``flags``\\ ）、如何从中提取结构化数据（\\ ``regex`` 或 ``extract_json``\\ ），以及如何命名它产出的值（\\"
" ``fields``\\ ）。无需手动编译或注册——你只要添加一个字典条目和一个测试，提取器就会自动识别它。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:13 f3438e61aebc481884d6712503d4c5a5
msgid ""
"If you would rather ship your scheme outside the main repository, see "
":doc:`plugins`. For the surrounding pipeline (how ``parse``, ``mutate_url`` "
"and ``extract`` fit together), see :doc:`how-extraction-works`."
msgstr ""
"如果你更愿意在主仓库之外发布你的提取方案，请参阅 :doc:`plugins`。关于整个流水线（\\ ``parse``\\ 、\\ "
"``mutate_url`` 和 ``extract`` 如何协同工作），请参阅 :doc:`how-extraction-works`。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:18 173a5103ad1044488999163feab7d2f7
msgid "TL;DR"
msgstr "速览"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:20 6b22736afebd4daf92776c14a68f89c6
msgid "Add a scheme to ``socid_extractor/schemes.py`` (regex- or JSON-based)."
msgstr "在 ``socid_extractor/schemes.py`` 中添加一个提取方案（基于 regex 或 JSON）。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:21 67a8af8da46b4e748ce64fbb0e3f5c82
msgid ""
"Use field names from the ontology (see :doc:`ontology`) — do not invent new "
"ones if a standard exists."
msgstr "使用字段本体中的字段名（参阅 :doc:`ontology`）——如果已有标准名称，不要新造。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:23 9f089a70fbad4129930bfe9c1e8b186c
msgid "Write a real-URL e2e test in ``tests/test_e2e.py``."
msgstr "在 ``tests/test_e2e.py`` 中编写一个针对真实 URL 的端到端测试。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:24 35db4265045846b09af5f4785a35e443
