#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:52 20d512ade1ad4365a667dfbbc4e34ac3
msgid ""
"Tuple of URL substrings. Used by the CLI flag ``--skip-fetch-if-no-url-"
"hint`` so batch users don't pay the HTTP cost on URLs that obviously can't "
"match. Add this for any scheme whose target domain isn't already obvious "
"from the scheme name."
msgstr ""
"URL 子字符串组成的元组。供 CLI 标志 ``--skip-fetch-if-no-url-hint`` 使用，这样批量用户就不必为明显无法匹配的 "
"URL 付出 HTTP 开销。对于目标域名无法从提取方案名称一眼看出的任何方案，都应添加它。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:57 67ac6d6cf6524e93bd3b24cdab5a1006
msgid ""
"Look at neighbouring schemes (GitHub, GitLab, Facebook group) for concrete "
"templates."
msgstr "可参考相邻的提取方案（GitHub、GitLab、Facebook group）作为具体模板。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:61 4c249e1ae3e9418594a13661e8a53331
msgid "A full annotated scheme"
msgstr "一个完整的带注释提取方案"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:63 84c36d0bf68f446a9c442a0b33be1ece
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The GitHub API scheme is a compact, complete example. It fetches "
"``https://api.github.com/users/{username}``, treats the body as JSON, and "
"maps the JSON keys onto ontology field names:"
msgstr ""
"GitHub API 提取方案是一个紧凑而完整的示例。它抓取 ``https://api.github.com/users/{username}``\\"
" ，将响应体视为 JSON，并把 JSON 的键映射到字段本体的字段名上："

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:115 fa68cbcf8d624d9b84d9a8abfeabe9c0
msgid ""
"When ``extract_json`` is set, the ``regex`` captures the JSON text, it is "
"parsed once, and every ``fields`` lambda receives the resulting object. When"
" it is **not** set, the body is matched with a named-group regex and each "
"lambda receives the ``re.Match`` group dict instead. The neighbouring "
"*Facebook group* scheme is the regex-with-named-groups variant — it has no "
"``extract_json`` and pulls ``username`` and ``uid`` straight out of the "
"pattern:"
msgstr ""
"当设置了 ``extract_json`` 时，\\ ``regex`` 会捕获 JSON 文本，它被解析一次，随后每个 ``fields`` "
"lambda 都会收到解析得到的对象。当\\ **未**\\ 设置它时，响应体会用带命名分组的正则进行匹配，每个 lambda 收到的则是 "
"``re.Match`` 的分组字典。相邻的 *Facebook group* 提取方案就是带命名分组的正则变体——它没有 "
"``extract_json``\\ ，而是直接从模式中提取 ``username`` 和 ``uid``\\ ："

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:132 8852615868ba43189995c4526e776c14
msgid ""
"``url_mutations`` (URL rewriting) is a CLI convenience only. Library and "
"Maigret callers pass an already-fetched page straight to ``extract()`` and "
"never trigger the rewrite. Do not rely on it in a scheme that must work when"
" called as a library."
msgstr ""
"``url_mutations``\\ （URL 改写）仅是一项 CLI 便利功能。库调用方和 Maigret 调用方会把已经抓取好的页面直接传给 "
"``extract()``\\ ，永远不会触发改写。在必须能作为库被调用的提取方案中，不要依赖它。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:138 025847a9984848fb83757749eef56291
msgid "Writing robust flags"
msgstr "编写健壮的 flags"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:140 f56f0e7b0287427dbc734d136800f06b
msgid ""
"``flags`` are the only thing standing between your scheme and false "
"positives on unrelated sites. ``extract()`` returns on the **first** "
"matching scheme, so a too-generic flag can shadow the correct one and "
"produce garbage output."
msgstr ""
"``flags`` 是你的提取方案与在无关站点上产生误报之间唯一的屏障。\\ ``extract()`` 会在\\ **第一个**\\ "
"匹配的提取方案处返回，因此过于宽泛的 flag 可能会遮蔽正确的方案并产出垃圾输出。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:144 4103aaf90cba4121952f1afffd8aa107
msgid "**Rules:**"
msgstr "**规则：**"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:146 d0e1dbf502f44a25b64599c4426bf46d
msgid ""
"**At least one flag must be unique to the platform.** Good: "
"``'OK.startupData'``, ``'canonicalPeriscopeUrl'``, ``'data-initial-data='``."
" Bad: ``'\"data\"'``, ``'\"user\"'``, ``'\"username\"'`` — match any JSON "
"API."
msgstr ""
"**至少要有一个 flag 是该平台独有的。** 好的：\\ ``'OK.startupData'``\\ 、\\ "
"``'canonicalPeriscopeUrl'``\\ 、\\ ``'data-initial-data='``\\ 。坏的：\\ "
"``'\"data\"'``\\ 、\\ ``'\"user\"'``\\ 、\\ ``'\"username\"'``——它们会匹配任何 JSON "
"API。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:150 a3d8321ab4f044c4bb939c8100a2bf4a
msgid ""
"**Prefer structural API field names** that only this site returns: "
"``'\"allowCrawler\"'`` (Wattpad), ``'\"dateJoined\"'`` + "
"``'\"socialMediaLinks\"'`` (Hashnode), ``'\"creatorTraders\"'`` (Manifold). "
"These survive redesigns."
msgstr ""
"**优先使用只有该站点才会返回的、结构性的 API 字段名**\\ ：\\ ``'\"allowCrawler\"'``\\ （Wattpad）、\\ "
"``'\"dateJoined\"'`` + ``'\"socialMediaLinks\"'``\\ （Hashnode）、\\ "
"``'\"creatorTraders\"'``\\ （Manifold）。这些能在站点改版后依然有效。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:153 25bc74d1950b4dbfba47dec0bfb418b9
msgid ""
"**Never use a single short JSON key as the only flag.** "
"``'{\"username\":\"'`` alone matches dozens of APIs — always pair it with a "
"second platform-specific flag."
msgstr ""
"**切勿把单个短小的 JSON 键作为唯一的 flag。** 仅 ``'{\"username\":\"'`` 就能匹配数十个 "
"API——务必再搭配第二个平台专属的 flag。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:156 ab80d60230ed41a4abefbadccaba55cc
msgid ""
"**For HTML pages, use CSS class names or page-specific markers** instead of "
"generic tags: ``'osu-layout'``, ``'ProfileHeader_lblMemberName'``, "
"``'Aedu.User.set_viewed('``."
msgstr ""
"**对于 HTML 页面，请使用 CSS 类名或页面专属的标记**\\ ，而非通用标签：\\ ``'osu-layout'``\\ 、\\ "
"``'ProfileHeader_lblMemberName'``\\ 、\\ ``'Aedu.User.set_viewed('``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:159 8e926f6c68f047bb82ae96f1ec27a772
msgid ""
"**For RSC / escaped JSON**, remember flags check the raw response body. "
"Strings appear as ``\\\"field_name\\\"``, not ``\"field_name\"``. Prefer "
"unescaped markers from the surrounding HTML (``'op.gg/lol/summoners/'``)."
msgstr ""
"**对于 RSC / 转义后的 JSON**\\ ，请记住 flags 检查的是原始响应体。字符串会呈现为 "
"``\\\"field_name\\\"``\\ ，而非 ``\"field_name\"``\\ 。优先选用周围 HTML 中未转义的标记（\\ "
"``'op.gg/lol/summoners/'``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:162 02e8c314ec844738818507ddf7d26fd6
msgid ""
"**Flags must not depend on user data.** Don't use the username, display "
"name, or any value that varies between accounts — use structural API keys / "
"HTML markers instead."
msgstr ""
"**flags 不得依赖用户数据。** 不要使用用户名、显示名或任何在不同账户间会变化的值——请改用结构性的 API 键 / HTML 标记。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:165 3584b167c4264c89a277cd653b599d46
msgid ""
"**Test against 5–10 unrelated sites' responses** before submitting. Run "
"``maigret USER --site \"YourSite\" -vvv`` and check ``debug.log`` for false "
"triggers. A scheme that fires once for its target and zero times for others "
"is correct."
msgstr ""
"在提交前\\ **针对 5–10 个无关站点的响应进行测试**\\ 。运行 ``maigret USER --site \"YourSite\" "
"-vvv`` 并检查 ``debug.log`` 中有无误触发。一个对其目标只触发一次、对其他站点触发零次的提取方案才是正确的。"

