#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:203 b856b55b90f84eba97e232757e019a10
msgid "Field naming"
msgstr "字段命名"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:205 6c0002bf9731491286093b942d8a8d84
msgid ""
"Field names come from the project's field ontology — the standard names "
"(``username``, ``fullname``, ``created_at``, ``is_verified``, "
"``follower_count``, …) used across all schemes so downstream pipelines don't"
" need one mapping per site. Read :doc:`ontology` before naming fields."
msgstr ""
"字段名来自本项目的字段本体——即在所有提取方案中通用的标准名称（\\ ``username``\\ 、\\ ``fullname``\\ 、\\ "
"``created_at``\\ 、\\ ``is_verified``\\ 、\\ "
"``follower_count``……），这样下游流水线就不必为每个站点各写一套映射。在命名字段前请阅读 :doc:`ontology`。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:210 afb56a6b68564d668347c8e3038cc126
msgid ""
"Use the existing standard name when one fits — do **not** invent variants. "
"Common mistakes: ``verified`` → use ``is_verified``; ``joined`` / "
"``registration`` → use ``created_at``; ``followers_count`` → use "
"``follower_count`` (singular noun + ``_count``)."
msgstr ""
"当已有合适的标准名称时就使用它——**不要**\\ 自造变体。常见错误：\\ ``verified`` → 应用 ``is_verified``\\ "
"；\\ ``joined`` / ``registration`` → 应用 ``created_at``\\ ；\\ "
"``followers_count`` → 应用 ``follower_count``\\ （单数名词 + ``_count``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:214 e1c086df5b784877a96269fdc41906b4
msgid ""
"The ``name`` API field is ambiguous — map it to ``fullname`` if it's a "
"display name, or ``username`` if it's a handle."
msgstr ""
"``name`` 这个 API 字段含义不明确——如果它是显示名，就映射到 ``fullname``\\ ；如果它是账号标识（handle），就映射到 "
"``username``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:216 5502316e779e42708436ef1a71a5ca2c
msgid ""
"Only create a platform-specific field (with a prefix like ``osu_pp``, "
"``gog_games_owned``) when the data genuinely doesn't fit any standard "
"category."
msgstr ""
"只有当数据确实不属于任何标准类别时，才创建平台专属字段（使用如 ``osu_pp``\\ 、\\ ``gog_games_owned`` 之类的前缀）。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:219 339ad4cd0a654046bcbfe1050b0f2f3e
msgid ""
"Boolean flags use the ``is_*`` prefix and are stringified (``'True'`` / "
"``'False'``)."
msgstr "布尔标志使用 ``is_*`` 前缀，并以字符串形式表示（\\ ``'True'`` / ``'False'``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:222 671bf632cbe64a1f91a31c435b4081db
msgid ""
"If you think a new standard field is warranted, propose adding it to the "
"ontology in the same PR."
msgstr "如果你认为有必要新增一个标准字段，请在同一个 PR 中提议将其加入字段本体。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:226 c0830f6157d2464f8a6f98d87bc048a0
msgid "Write the e2e test"
msgstr "编写端到端测试"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:228 d630a6e64aae4b5084d8c4d82e50c823
msgid ""
"Every new scheme requires at least one e2e test in ``tests/test_e2e.py`` "
"against a real URL or API response. Unit tests with inline fixtures (in "
"``tests/test_socid_improvements.py``) are also welcome but do not replace "
"e2e coverage."
msgstr ""
"每个新的提取方案都需要在 ``tests/test_e2e.py`` 中至少有一个针对真实 URL 或 API "
"响应的端到端测试。带内联夹具的单元测试（位于 ``tests/test_socid_improvements.py``\\ "
"）也很受欢迎，但不能替代端到端测试的覆盖。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:234 7bfdff21b9c24546a29364f0155fd16e
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "工作流程"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:236 578659408fa14f00ad9b99873bf1097f
msgid ""
"Run the extractor against the target URL and capture its output. The output "
"is one ``field: value`` per line:"
msgstr "针对目标 URL 运行提取器并捕获其输出。输出为每行一个 ``field: value``\\ ："

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:243 e6713b8d315243eab19fa87e7be9df70
msgid ""
"Add a new test function to ``tests/test_e2e.py`` and paste those lines into "
"its body:"
msgstr "在 ``tests/test_e2e.py`` 中添加一个新的测试函数，并把那些行粘贴到函数体中："

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:253 b92dfe2b29f046bfaf564a5f08327197
msgid ""
"Convert the pasted lines into assertions. ``reformat.sh`` rewrites each "
"``field: value`` line into ``assert info.get(\"field\") == \"value\"``:"
msgstr ""
"把粘贴的行转换为断言。\\ ``reformat.sh`` 会将每一行 ``field: value`` 改写为 ``assert "
"info.get(\"field\") == \"value\"``\\ ："

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:260 991bf75979804395a7ee4b3cd3db6b14
msgid "Run the test:"
msgstr "运行测试："

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:267 54bba63770324c2090530f7209884689
msgid "Test docstring — used by ``revision.py``"
msgstr "测试的 docstring——供 ``revision.py`` 使用"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:269 a9c0eb4b013943539df4d9cdf1d76a1c
msgid ""
"Put the **scheme name(s)** from ``schemes.py`` in the test docstring, one "
"per line. ``revision.py`` matches tests to schemes via this docstring to "
"generate ``METHODS.md``. If a single test covers two schemes (e.g. an HTML "
"page plus the JSON API for the same site), list both:"
msgstr ""
"把 ``schemes.py`` 中的\\ **提取方案名称**\\ 写入测试的 docstring，每行一个。\\ ``revision.py`` "
"通过这个 docstring 将测试与提取方案对应起来，从而生成 ``METHODS.md``\\ 。如果单个测试覆盖了两个提取方案（例如同一站点的 "
"HTML 页面加上 JSON API），就把两个都列出："

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:284 729e66d4646246a38f3f568070288285
msgid "Test fixtures with HTML"
msgstr "带 HTML 的测试夹具"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:286 f7f2468091554d6e8e096837dce601bd
msgid ""
"If your test asserts against parsed HTML (display names, bios containing "
"punctuation), copy the **exact** characters from the real response — "
"including HTML entities like ``&#064;`` instead of ``@``. Tests that "
"silently \"fix\" entities pass against fixtures and fail against the live "
"site."
msgstr ""
"如果你的测试是针对解析后的 HTML 进行断言（显示名、含标点的简介），请从真实响应中复制\\ **完全一致**\\ 的字符——包括像 "
"``&#064;`` 这样的 HTML 实体，而不是 ``@``\\ 。悄悄“修正”实体的测试对夹具能通过，但对线上站点会失败。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:292 df5b921d82894fd6a3f2a325969aa2e5
msgid "Flaky / blocked sites"
msgstr "不稳定 / 被封锁的站点"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:294 1078ec59f893403aa03312f2b44b94e7
msgid "If the site is unreliable from CI, mark the test:"
msgstr "如果该站点在 CI 中不可靠，请给测试打上标记："

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:296 4da91b618cc14b0a9166f29b231a26eb
msgid ""
"``@pytest.mark.github_failed`` — GitHub Actions IPs are blocked by the site."
msgstr "``@pytest.mark.github_failed``——GitHub Actions 的 IP 被该站点封锁。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:297 5c63ab839b334bfb9d3e43a5bed48a0a
msgid "``@pytest.mark.rate_limited`` — anti-bot / captcha / rate limiting."
msgstr "``@pytest.mark.rate_limited``——反机器人 / 验证码 / 限速。"

#: ../../source/adding-a-scheme.rst:298 9556d1c8b9cd4334a03ead8404210f70
msgid ""
"``@pytest.mark.requires_cookies`` — cookies are required to get content."
msgstr "``@pytest.mark.requires_cookies``——需要 cookies 才能获取内容。"

